378742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your duties don't end at digging dirt. Why were you brought here? Why is the town cut off from the world? And who is watching from the shadows as dusk falls? Investigation is as vital as irrigation. Balance the toil of the fields with the hunt for answers. Every crop you harvest might buy the townsfolk another day of life, but every secret you unearth brings you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Navigate the stillness of the fields as the sun sets, and learn to live with the shadows that follow you home.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645050/extras/73b2f4fb240c3f10e2b01fa5a16bcee6.webp?t=1777378742\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645050/extras/73b2f4fb240c3f10e2b01fa5a16bcee6.poster.avif?t=1777378742\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=140 /></picture></span> </p>", "short_description": "A gritty farming thriller where your safety depends on the yield. Bound to a dying farm, you must dig, plant, irrigate, and cut your way through the decay. Uncover buried secrets, both in the soil and quietly brewing within the village. The only way out is through the harvest.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Norwegian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645050/4d8d09e80ad273a0e54abcbd514db7d360c1d1b6/header.jpg?t=1777378742", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645050/505e23b233fc3a760c3fbb5ed86d28c1398ed860/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777378742", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645050/505e23b233fc3a760c3fbb5ed86d28c1398ed8